<%
  pageTitle = 'Our Mission';
  pageDescription = 'Binary Hub exists to open doors to technology education through teaching, mentorship, and real-world projects.';
  activeNav = '';
  extraCss = '<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/pages.css">';
%>
<%- include('partials/head') %>
<%- include('partials/nav') %>

<main>
  <header class="bh-page-hero">
    <div class="bh-container">
      <h1>Our mission is access.</h1>
      <p class="bh-lead">Technology should not be a privilege of place or income. Binary Hub exists to open doors through teaching, mentorship, and real-world projects.</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="bh-section" style="padding-top:0;">
    <div class="bh-container" style="max-width:48rem;">
      <div class="detail-panel bh-reveal" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
        <p style="font-size:1.15rem;line-height:1.7;color:var(--bh-ink);">We equip young people with digital and creative skills, connect them to opportunity, and nurture leaders who give back to their communities.</p>
      </div>
      <p class="bh-reveal" style="color:var(--bh-ink-soft);line-height:1.75;margin-bottom:1rem;">Binary Hub began with a simple observation: talent is everywhere, but structured pathways into tech are not. Our mission is to close that gap with rigorous, industry-aligned programs delivered in welcoming spaces: online, on campus, and through outreach.</p>
      <p class="bh-reveal" style="color:var(--bh-ink-soft);line-height:1.75;margin-bottom:1rem;">We measure success not only by certificates, but by confidence gained, portfolios shipped, internships secured, and alumni who mentor the next cohort. Every course, event, and partnership is designed to compound that impact.</p>
      <p class="bh-reveal" style="color:var(--bh-ink-soft);line-height:1.75;margin-bottom:2rem;">We are committed to ethical practice: transparent admissions, inclusive classrooms, and honest conversations about the responsibilities that come with building technology for others.</p>

      <div class="bh-grid-3 bh-reveal">
        <div class="detail-panel">
          <div style="width:2.5rem;height:2.5rem;border-radius:10px;background:var(--bh-accent-soft);color:var(--bh-accent);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:0.85rem;"><i class="fas fa-graduation-cap"></i></div>
          <h3 style="font-size:1.1rem;margin-bottom:0.4rem;">Teach with depth</h3>
          <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:var(--bh-ink-soft);">Curricula that mirror how teams actually ship, not tick-box tutorials.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-panel">
          <div style="width:2.5rem;height:2.5rem;border-radius:10px;background:var(--bh-accent-soft);color:var(--bh-accent);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:0.85rem;"><i class="fas fa-handshake"></i></div>
          <h3 style="font-size:1.1rem;margin-bottom:0.4rem;">Bridge to industry</h3>
          <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:var(--bh-ink-soft);">Partnerships that turn learning into interviews, briefs, and paid work.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-panel">
          <div style="width:2.5rem;height:2.5rem;border-radius:10px;background:var(--bh-accent-soft);color:var(--bh-accent);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:0.85rem;"><i class="fas fa-seedling"></i></div>
          <h3 style="font-size:1.1rem;margin-bottom:0.4rem;">Grow leaders</h3>
          <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:var(--bh-ink-soft);">Peer teaching, community projects, and scholarships that multiply reach.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</main>
<%- include('partials/scripts') %>
